          "rating": 5,
          "description": "Our friend showed us their beautiful library. I could image that I would like to be here for study in quiet study rooms or computer labs if I were a Michigan student. There were many beautiful wallpapers, pictures and windows. It was freezing outside, but there were a few students studying inside. Hopefully, the weather would not get worse this Saturday. The game must be crazy this year.",
          "date": "10 months ago",
          "date_iso8601": "2025-11-28T01:39:21+00:00"
        },
        {
          "rating": 3,
          "description": "The library is not a very good place to study. Although they have done some renovations recently, it is still a bit outdated and more work needs to be done. Also, there are no quiet places. I wish that the library could have areas where groups can study and chat and other areas for quiet studying.",
          "date": "7 years ago",
          "date_iso8601": "2019-03-09T01:08:00+00:00"
        },
        {
          "rating": 4,
          "description": "The Bert’s Cafe has good latte!",
          "date": "4 years ago",
          "date_iso8601": "2022-02-15T13:24:46+00:00"
        },
        {
          "rating": 5,
          "description": "I really like the Shapiro library because of all the resources that are there for students. There are obviously computers, lounges, and a cafe, but even for students who don't go to the university it can be a good study spot. However during the school year it is a bit of challenge to get a study spot.",
          "date": "4 years ago",
          "date_iso8601": "2022-07-12T13:19:29+00:00"
        },
        {
          "rating": 4,
          "description": "Great place to study, and a great location too. Can get crowded sometimes, especially before a rly big exam.\nWould still definitely recommend if you're looking for a place to study, and are an undergraduate.",
